[{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"乘法表示的是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"求几个相同加数的和"},{"key":"B","text":"从总数里去掉一部分"},{"key":"C","text":"比较谁更大"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"例如 2＋2＋2 可以写成 2×3。","verify":"'求几个相同加数的和'","id":"cnm_p038_q1","topicId":"cnm_p038"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"3 个 2 相加，和是多少？","answer":"6","explanation":"2＋2＋2＝6，也就是 2×3＝6。","verify":"2+2+2","id":"cnm_p038_q2","topicId":"cnm_p038"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"每组有 3 人，有这样的 4 组。一共有多少人？","answer":"12","explanation":"4 个 3 相加，写成 3×4＝12。","verify":"3*4","id":"cnm_p038_q3","topicId":"cnm_p038"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"4＋4＋4 表示几个 4 相加？","answer":"3","explanation":"相同加数 4 出现了 3 次，是 3 个 4。","verify":"3","id":"cnm_p038_q4","topicId":"cnm_p038"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"每行 2 个座位，有 6 行。一共有多少个座位？","answer":"12","explanation":"二六十二，2×6＝12。","verify":"2*6","id":"cnm_p039_q1","topicId":"cnm_p039"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"每盘 3 个苹果，有 4 盘。一共有多少个？","answer":"12","explanation":"三四十二，3×4＝12。","verify":"3*4","id":"cnm_p039_q2","topicId":"cnm_p039"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"每盒有 5 个皮球，一共 6 盒。一共有多少个？","answer":"30","explanation":"五六三十，5×6＝30。","verify":"5*6","id":"cnm_p039_q3","topicId":"cnm_p039"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"每行 4 棵树，有 3 行。又在旁边单种了 2 棵。树一共有多少棵？","answer":"14","explanation":"先用口诀算 4×3＝12，再加上 2 棵，是 14 棵。","verify":"4*3+2","id":"cnm_p039_q4","topicId":"cnm_p039"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"每组 3 人，有 6 组。求一共多少人，用哪种运算更合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"乘法"},{"key":"B","text":"加法一步步加不同的数"},{"key":"C","text":"减法"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"每组人数相同，求几个几，用乘法。","verify":"'乘法'","id":"cnm_p048_q1","topicId":"cnm_p048"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"小明先有 8 支笔，又买了 5 支。求现在有多少支，该用什么运算？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"加法"},{"key":"B","text":"乘法"},{"key":"C","text":"除法"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"原来有一些，又多了一些，两部分合起来用加法。","verify":"'加法'","id":"cnm_p048_q2","topicId":"cnm_p048"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"每盒 4 支彩笔，买 5 盒。下面哪一步最合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"用 4×5 求一共多少支"},{"key":"B","text":"用 4＋5 求一共多少支"},{"key":"C","text":"用 5－4 求差多少支"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"每盒支数相同，求 5 个 4，用乘法。","verify":"'用 4×5 求一共多少支'","id":"cnm_p048_q3","topicId":"cnm_p048"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"书架上有 3 层，每层 6 本书，又单放了 2 本。一共有多少本？","answer":"20","explanation":"先判断：相同的用乘法 6×3＝18，再加上 2，一共 20 本。","verify":"6*3+2","id":"cnm_p048_q4","topicId":"cnm_p048"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"算式里既有乘法又有加减法，要按怎样的顺序算？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"先算乘除，再算加减"},{"key":"B","text":"一律从左往右，乘号也不优先"},{"key":"C","text":"先算最大的数"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"有乘法和加减法时，先算乘法。","verify":"'先算乘除，再算加减'","id":"cnm_p057_q1","topicId":"cnm_p057"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"按正确顺序，3×4＋5 的结果是多少？","answer":"17","explanation":"先算 3×4＝12，再加 5，得 17。","verify":"3*4+5","id":"cnm_p057_q2","topicId":"cnm_p057"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"每盒 4 支笔，买 3 盒，又单买 2 支。一共有多少支？","answer":"14","explanation":"先算 4×3＝12，再加上 2，得 14。","verify":"4*3+2","id":"cnm_p057_q3","topicId":"cnm_p057"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"20－2×6，要先算乘法。结果是多少？","answer":"8","explanation":"先算 2×6＝12，再算 20－12＝8。不能先用 20 减 2。","verify":"20-2*6","id":"cnm_p057_q4","topicId":"cnm_p057"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"每支铅笔 2 元，买 5 支。一共要付多少元？","answer":"10","explanation":"2×5＝10（元）。","verify":"2*5","id":"cnm_p262_q1","topicId":"cnm_p262"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"每本练习本 3 元，买 4 本。一共多少元？","answer":"12","explanation":"3×4＝12（元）。","verify":"3*4","id":"cnm_p262_q2","topicId":"cnm_p262"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"橡皮每块 1 元，彩笔每盒 6 元。买 1 块橡皮和 2 盒彩笔，一共多少元？","answer":"13","explanation":"彩笔 6×2＝12 元，再加橡皮 1 元，一共 13 元。","verify":"1+6*2","id":"cnm_p262_q3","topicId":"cnm_p262"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"每本故事书 8 元，小华带了 20 元，买了 2 本。还剩多少元？","answer":"4","explanation":"两本 8×2＝16 元，20－16＝4 元。","verify":"20-8*2","id":"cnm_p262_q4","topicId":"cnm_p262"}]
